tc.research_category.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY=Squirrel Witchery
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_SQUIRREL.title=Squirrels
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_SQUIRREL.stage.1=These small, lively beasts can be found in forests of every description. From familiar woodlands to the strangest distant groves, squirrels appear wherever trees gather thickly enough to offer them shelter.<IMG>squirrelwitchery:textures/ui/squirrel_bestiary.png:0:0:256:150:0.5</IMG>Their fondness for nuts is extraordinary. Merely holding one is often enough to lure a nearby squirrel closer, and the creatures seem quite content to make nuts the center of their diet.<BR>Thaumic examination reveals the Bestia expected of an animal, but also a surprisingly strong concentration of Risunium. Perhaps their playful nature and peculiar appetite offer some clue as to why this aspect gathers within them.
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_NUTS.title=Nuts
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_NUTS.stage.1=Breaking leaves has revealed a surprising source of essentia: nuts. Closer examination shows that they contain traces of Risunium essentia. I must study this new aspect and see what secrets it holds.
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_RISUNIC_STUDIES.title=Risunic Studies
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_RISUNIC_STUDIES.stage.1=Risunium as a form of essentia has shown to be unlike any other that I have encountered. Before I attempt to shape this unusual essentia into more elaborate creations, I should develop a theory that explains its peculiar affinities.
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_RISUNIC_STUDIES.stage.2=My notes are beginning to reveal a coherent pattern. Risunium responds especially well to playful ideas, unconventional materials, and a willingness to follow curious trains of thought. With this framework established, I can begin finding practical uses for it.<BR>I have also discovered a most curious property: Risunium vis crystals resonate with every primal aspect. Unlike ordinary vis crystals, they can occupy any of the six crystal slots around an arcane workbench.
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_RISUNIC_AUROMANCY.title=Risunic Auromancy
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_RISUNIC_AUROMANCY.stage.1=Risunium's affinity for every primal aspect suggests a useful role in focused spellcraft. Its behavior differs from vis itself: rather than supplying raw power, it seems eager to mediate between otherwise incompatible arcane patterns. I must reconcile this property with the principles of auromancy before attempting to build with it.
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_RISUNIC_AUROMANCY.stage.2=My calculations show that Risunium can sit alongside a conventional focus without disturbing its spell pattern. The spell should continue to draw ordinary vis from the aura, while Risunium provides a separate path through which auxiliary components can influence the working. This separation may permit a casting implement whose behavior can be expanded without rebuilding the focus within it.
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_RISUNIC_ARTIFICE.title=Risunic Artifice
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_RISUNIC_ARTIFICE.stage.1=Risunium's affinity for unconventional structures suggests that it may have applications beyond alchemy and spellcraft. If I am to incorporate it into thaumaturgical devices, I must determine how its playful, mutable nature interacts with the ordered principles of artifice.
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_RISUNIC_ARTIFICE.stage.2=My studies suggest that Risunium does not replace the mechanisms of conventional artifice. Instead, it forms responsive links between components, allowing a device to alter its behavior without rebuilding its underlying structure. With this foundation established, I can begin developing specialized Risunic mechanisms.
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_WITCH_SHOTGUN.title=Witch's Shotgun
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_WITCH_SHOTGUN.stage.1=A compact alchemical brass barrel and a simple mechanism should let me release Risunium as a broad burst. A greatwood stock will keep the device steady while the Risunic crystal splits the discharge into several instantaneous rays.
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_WITCH_SHOTGUN.stage.2=The Witch's Shotgun releases multiple rays in a wide cone the instant it is fired. It is devastating at close range, while its rapidly spreading discharge can strike several targets farther away. Each shot drains 20 Risunium, and the weapon can be replenished from a Warded Jar in the same manner as my other Risunic implements.
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_WITCH_STAFF.title=Witch's Staff
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_WITCH_STAFF.stage.1=A caster's gauntlet leaves little room for the additional structure my design requires. I first need a compact Risunic intermediary. By adapting the recipe for a blank lesser focus and replacing its Ordo crystal with a Risunium vis crystal, I should be able to create a Risunic Foci suited to binding an implement and its attachments together.
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_WITCH_STAFF.stage.2=The Risunic Foci is stable and receptive, exactly as my calculations predicted. By mounting it atop a long wooden haft and balancing the assembly with each primal aspect, I should be able to create a staff that channels ordinary vis as reliably as a caster's gauntlet while preserving the Foci's attachment framework.
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_WITCH_STAFF.stage.3=The Witch's Staff draws vis directly from the surrounding aura to power the spell focus placed within it. The Risunic Foci does not serve as fuel; it anchors a separate framework through which Risunic attachments can modify spells without interfering with their ordinary vis supply.
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_WITCH_STAFF_ATTACHMENTS.title=Risunic Staff Attachments
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_WITCH_STAFF_ATTACHMENTS.stage.1=The framework anchored by the Risunic Foci should accept compact mechanisms capable of altering a spell as it passes through the staff. Applying the principles of artifice may allow me to construct these mechanisms as interchangeable attachments rather than permanent additions.
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_WITCH_STAFF_ATTACHMENTS.stage.2=An alchemical brass plate provides a stable base upon which I can mount a Risunium vis crystal and a component sympathetic to the desired effect. Glowstone dust intensifies a spell's power, redstone prolongs effects capable of lingering, and a rabbit's foot lends greater speed to projectiles. Squirrel Fur serves as the final binding element to the staff. Each attachment draws a small amount of Risunium from the staff whenever it successfully modifies a spell.
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_WITCH_COSTUME.title=Witch's Garb
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_WITCH_COSTUME.stage.1=Squirrel fur is naturally saturated with Risunium, making it unusually receptive to thaumaturgical shaping. I have devised patterns that weave it into a hat, robe, skirt, and boots. Each piece reduces the vis cost of my workings, and wearing the complete ensemble should provide a considerable benefit.
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_DARK_WITCH_COSTUME.title=Dark Witch's Garb
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_DARK_WITCH_COSTUME.stage.1=My studies of the eldritch have revealed how void metal can be worked into thaumaturgical attire. The cheerful garb I devised before could serve as a foundation for something darker, but shaping so much hungry metal around Risunium will be a dangerous undertaking.
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_DARK_WITCH_COSTUME.stage.2=By fusing each piece of my witch's garb with its void metal counterpart, I can create a complete set of dark witch's garb. It offers a far greater vis discount and the protection of void metal, though wearing it will expose me to the same warping influence as my other eldritch creations.
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_WITCH_BROOM.title=Witch's Broom
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_WITCH_BROOM.stage.1=Binding Aer and Risunium into a simple framework of sticks and squirrel fur may produce sustained flight. Aer should provide lift, while Risunium lends the mundane materials enough arcane vitality to remain aloft and respond to a rider.<BR>If my theory is sound, I should be able to fashion a simple yet effective flying implement: the Witch's Broom.
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_WITCH_BROOM.stage.2=My Witch's Broom works even better than expected. Once mounted, it travels continuously in the direction I face, and I can control its altitude independently.<BR>The broom steadily consumes Risunium while in flight. When its internal reserve is exhausted, it can no longer remain aloft and returns to its portable form.<BR>I can replenish this reserve by using the broom on a Warded Jar containing Risunium. Sneaking while holding the broom will instead draw Risunium from a suitable jar in my inventory. With enough essentia at hand, even long journeys should prove practical.

card.squirrel_field_notes.name=Squirrel Field Notes
card.squirrel_field_notes.text=You organize your scattered observations about nuts, squirrels, and Risunium into a more useful form. Gain 20 Squirrel Witchery.
card.nut_research.name=Nut Research
card.nut_research.text=Sometimes the best way to understand a nut is to take it apart. Consume a nut to gain 25 Squirrel Witchery.
card.risunic_resonance.name=Risunic Resonance
card.risunic_resonance.text=You test a Risunium vis crystal against a series of increasingly unlikely stimuli. Consume the crystal to gain 30 Squirrel Witchery and one bonus draw.
